/*
 * Hawaii, Well Planned: content data.
 *
 * Content model notes (PRD §10):
 *  - Every listing separates editorial fields ("why") from verifiable facts
 *    (links, reservations, access) and keeps a `verified` record.
 *  - `verified.date === null` means the entry is an editorial draft that has
 *    NOT been checked against the official source yet. The UI shows that
 *    plainly and routes people to the official source instead.
 *  - Phone numbers and street addresses are only shown when verified; until
 *    then the card links to a map search and the official site.
 *  - Coordinates are approximate and used only for drive-time estimates.
 */

